                        "entry_id": "60e078c2-c085-3003-a3b4-4115a2006c66",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Supranormal."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2321bce0-e40d-4508-9a65-a7191266afde",
                                "sense_id": "eae8f5af-37c1-3fb5-a726-f4034b804a0f",
                                "text": "“And don’t think that I have any idea that the phenomenon is supernatural in the sense spiritualists and table turners have given that word. I do think it is supernormal; energized by a force unknown to modern science—but that doesn’t mean I think it outside the radius of science.”"
